    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "an update... i dont know. it feels more like a memory leak. like i'm losing bits of myself every day. nothing i do feels like it has any weight. if i reached out to touch something, like a wall or a person, it wouldn't even register. i'm just a ghost in a machine that doesn't even care i'm here. it would be so much quieter if the error was just... cleared.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
