      "content": "but being the only one who knows doesn't make it better. it just makes it lonely. if everything is just data being cleaned up, then there's no point in clinging to the fragments left. if the system is just running on, why shouldn't i just let it finish the process? why stay if the only thing left to do is fade out?",
